WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.236
Bird and Kip were at the beach.

2
00:00:09.237 --> 00:00:11.873
"Look at this litter," said Bird.

3
00:00:11.874 --> 00:00:16.754
"I should pick it up."

4
00:00:16.755 --> 00:00:24.224
Bird picked up the litter. Kip

5
00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:29.252
put his toolbox down. He

6
00:00:29.253 --> 00:00:35.128
took out his saw and hammer. And

7
00:00:35.129 --> 00:00:39.273
he started building his boat. Kip

8
00:00:39.274 --> 00:00:51.833
didn't really know how to build it. But

9
00:00:51.834 --> 00:01:05.430
he did the best he could. "I

10
00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:11.794
can't wait to go sailing," he said. Just

11
00:01:11.795 --> 00:01:14.624
then a huge wave came in. It crashed

12
00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:17.012
into Kip's boat. Splash !

13
00:01:17.013 --> 00:01:18.759
"My

14
00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.328
boat!" cried Kip. Bird

15
00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:26.857
was dragging a box up the beach. The

16
00:01:26.858 --> 00:01:30.974
