17
00:01:30.975 --> 00:01:32.870
!

18
00:01:32.871 --> 00:01:35.294
Bird fell into the box.

19
00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:42.472
"Squawk!" she cried.

20
00:01:42.473 --> 00:01:45.912
Then the box zoomed straight toward Kip. "Look

21
00:01:45.913 --> 00:01:49.381
